  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: N/A</em></p>\n<p>You are exceptionally speedy and agile. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your speed increases by 10 feet.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When you use the Dash action, difficult terrain doesn't cost you extra movement on that turn.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When you make a melee attack against a creature, you don't provoke opportunity attacks from that creature for the rest of the turn, whether you hit or not.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
